        "text": "the framework 13 pro is the macbook pro of linux\n\n&gt;haptic touchpad\n&gt;great touchscreen\n&gt;insane battery life\n&gt;full aluminum chassis\n&gt;comfortable keyboard\n\nframework sent me a pre-production unit and i'm genuinely blown away by this machine\n\ni've been daily driving a framework https://t.co/pnUoB8cA1k"
      }
